MODIFICATIONS

This repository is a derivative work of the upstream project above, maintained
at https://github.com/lnatpunblhna/gopub. Files in this repository have been
modified relative to upstream. Notable changes include:

  - Go module path changed from github.com/linclin/gopub to
    github.com/lnatpunblhna/gopub.
  - HTTP layer migrated from Beego to Echo v4.
  - JWT library replaced: github.com/dgrijalva/jwt-go (deprecated) ->
    github.com/golang-jwt/jwt/v5.
  - Added configurable SSH algorithms for remote file transfers.
  - Added user deletion feature and assorted bug fixes.
  - Added Release packaging workflow and automatic git branch adaptation.
  - Removed generated files from version control.

The complete, authoritative record of modifications is the git history of this
repository; the list above is a summary and is not exhaustive.
